& [Delineation]
  + reusable means exact forms or transition behavior can be imported by reference under a later signature
  + candidate_only means part of the mechanism exists but the required correspondence or authority contract does not
  + absent means implementation must wait for its separately signed SWA contract
  + this audit grants no workspace process provider mutation publication effect persistence or SOP activation authority
